      "id": "NUM.1.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.1.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the LORD spoke to Moses in the wilderness of Sinai, in the tabernacle of the congregation, on the first ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "day",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of the second month, in the second year after they had come out of the land of Egypt, saying,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.1.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.1.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Take ye the sum of all the congregation of the children of Israel, after their families by the house of their fathers, with the number of ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "their",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " names, every male by their poll:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.1.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.1.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "From twenty years old and upward, all that are able to go forth to war in Israel; thou and Aaron shall number them by their armies.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.1.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.1.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And with you there shall be a man of every tribe; every one head of the house of his fathers.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.1.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.1.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And these ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the names of the men that shall stand with you: Of ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "the tribe of",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Reuben; Elizur the son of Shedeur.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
