      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.1.53",
      "verse": 53,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But the Levites shall pitch around the tabernacle of testimony; that there may be no wrath upon the congregation of the children of Israel: and the Levites shall keep the charge of the tabernacle of testimony.",
